    "flash": {
      "enabled": true,
      "count": 1,
      "spec": {
        "partitionMap": [
          {
            "type": "TUYA_FLASH_TYPE_KV_KEY",
            "name": "kv_key",
            "startAddr": "0x000000",
            "endAddr": "0x001000",
            "size": 4096,
            "blockSize": 4096
          },
          {
            "type": "TUYA_FLASH_TYPE_KV_DATA",
            "name": "kv_data",
            "startAddr": "0x001000",
            "endAddr": "0x009000",
            "size": 32768,
            "blockSize": 4096
          },
          {
            "type": "TUYA_FLASH_TYPE_UF",
            "name": "uf",
            "startAddr": "0x009000",
            "endAddr": "0x011000",
            "size": 32768,
            "blockSize": 4096
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "This platform has no fixed APP/OTA partition table like other platforms — the M4 app image + Gecko Bootloader + NWP firmware are flashed as one opaque image by Silicon Labs' Simplicity Commander, and TuyaOpen's tkl_flash_get_one_type_info() has no case for querying that image's size or boundaries. Only these 3 small sub-partitions (LittleFS KV/UF storage, per tkl_flash.c's PARTITION_SIZE/SIMPLE_FLASH_SIZE/UF_PARTITION_SIZE constants) are knowable ahead of a build. The real app image size is read from the compiled *_QIO_*.bin after building (src/host/buildActions.ts) — it varies per build and is not a fixed platform fact, so it is deliberately not listed here.",
          "zh-CN": "该平台没有其他平台那种固定的 APP/OTA 分区表——M4 应用镜像 + Gecko Bootloader + NWP 固件是由 Silicon Labs 的 Simplicity Commander 整体烧录的一个不透明镜像，TuyaOpen 的 tkl_flash_get_one_type_info() 没有查询它大小/边界的分支。编译之前只有这 3 个小的 LittleFS KV/UF 子分区是能确定的（来自 tkl_flash.c 的 PARTITION_SIZE/SIMPLE_FLASH_SIZE/UF_PARTITION_SIZE 常量）。真实的 app 镜像大小是编译后从 *_QIO_*.bin 里读出来的（src/host/buildActions.ts）——它每次编译都会变，不是平台固定值，所以这里故意不列。"
        }
      }
    }
  },
